      "message": "fix(tools): delete and new document keep the component records right\n\n- The generic DeleteEntity (the tree's delete) now restores a tool's\n  component stack on undo. DeleteTool and DeleteEntity snapshot and land\n  one shared list, ToolRecords, so a new tool record cannot be missed by\n  one delete path.\n- NewDocument clears the component table, as project open does.\n- app re-exports component, component_geometry and connection_code of\n  camcraft_tools, so callers outside app can make a table row.\n\nPinned by review_generic_delete_undo_keeps_assembly (tool_library_holders)\nand new_document_clears_the_component_table (ui machine).\n\nRefs #3644\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
